Mana cost: {3}{R}
Type: Sorcery
Exile all Inscription cards from your graveyard and all exiled Inscription cards you own. For each card exiled this way, you may inscribe it onto a creature you control. *(Whenever that creature attacks, its controller may cast a copy of the inscribed card without paying its mana cost.)*

