Mana cost: {3}{R}
Type: Sorcery
Exile all Inscription cards from your graveyard and all exiled Inscription cards you own. For each card exiled this way, you may do the following: [Choose a creature you control, then record that creature in the inscribed host collection of the iterated card while that source remains in exile and those members remain on the battlefield; Then that creature gains "Whenever this creature attacks, you may cast a copy of the iterated card without paying its mana cost." for as long as the iterated card remains exiled and that creature remains on the battlefield only while the iterated card has custom keyword "Inscribe"].

